{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n 今日は1stアルバム\n 真っ白なものは汚したくなる\n の発売日です٩(^‿^)۶\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6D7K76P54HMXGQJC0THRR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n わーーーい٩(^‿^)۶\n \n \n \n いっぱい聞いてください٩(^‿^)۶\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6D8QSYCGWGAE2VKYP75FY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n ひらがなけやきの新曲\n 永遠の白線\n とっても夏らしくて大好きです♡\n \n \n いっぱい聞いてください♡\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6D9PBT7QG8V2DDVQW2BED","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n 32人の新曲\n 太陽は見上げる人を選ばない\n もとっても好きです〜\n \n また32人で曲をいただけで嬉しいです！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6DAMY0DYW6B3V1HFH194X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n 私は特に\n 危なっかしい計画が\n とっても大好きです！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6DBM8P3NH4VFFERT1AV3H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 今年の夏は\n 欅坂46の1stアルバム\n 真っ白なものは汚したくなる\n をいっぱい聞いて\n 暑い夏を乗り切りましょう！\n \n \n \n 私もいっぱい聞いて乗り切ります！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6DCMAXPMFKH0CKKWMRRQ8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n 今日可愛くて真っ白で\n 絶対に汚したくない\n さりなちゃんとともにお送りしました〜\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6DDKX0W914ZE34H3C7PHE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6DEKN3GYKBPKSV0ADA7KV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6DFJ9QXKCFZJA7A6T51DN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 最後まで読んでくれてありがとうございます。"}],"source":"archive"}